  "body": "Build Your Dream Home\r\n24b Gulf Harbour Drive, Gulf Harbour\r\n500m2 buildable section/762m2 Land \r\n\r\n\r\nPositioned in the coastal community of Gulf Harbour, this sun-drenched, north-facing elevated freehold section at 24b Gulf Harbour Drive offers an opportunity to secure your place in one of Auckland’s desirable lifestyle locations.\r\nWhether you’re planning your first home, a stylish down-sizer, or an investment build, this site provides the perfect foundation to bring your dream.\r\n\r\nAttributes:\r\n* Freehold section.\r\n* Peaceful, family-friendly neighbourhood.\r\n* Close to marina, boat ramps, fishing, beaches, coastal walkways including Shakespeare Regional Park, and Whangaparaoa Golf course.\r\n* Walkable to Gulf Harbour shops, cafes, and amenities.\r\n* Zoned for quality local schools and within walking distance to Wentworth College and Primary School.\r\n* Easy access to ferry services to Auckland CBD.\r\n* Services installed (not yet connected).\r\n\r\nEnjoy the seaside lifestyle while staying connected to the city. With sections in Gulf Harbour becoming increasingly scarce, this is your chance to secure land and design a home tailored to your needs.\r\n\r\nStart building your future at 24b Gulf Harbour Drive, Gulf Harbour.\r\nPrice by negotiation.\r\n\r\nFor enquiries contact 021 762 690.",
